=2 Walkthrough
* Start the quest by talking to {n:Aurege} (F-3) near {z:Northern San d'Oria} Home Point #4, outside of the Carpenter's Guild.
* (Optional): Talk to {n:Nonterene} (I-10) at the Parade Grounds near Victory Arch.
* {n:Varchet} is located in Southern San d'Oria at (L-6) right next to the fountains.
* You'll need to gamble against him. Each attempt against him costs 5 gil. Keep trading until you win.
** Gambling against him is still possible after this quest is complete.
* After winning, return and talk to Aurege for your reward.

=2 Notes
* This quest does not appear in your log until it is completed.
* Exit the Gambler was taken a bit literally when {n:Varchet} was temporarily removed from the game in an emergency maintenance in September 2007.[1]
** A Moogle was put in his spot, who would inform adventurers that Varchet {p:fell into financial ruin|JP Button} __(information needed)__ or {p:had the flu|Azure Ailments} __(information needed)__ or something and couldn't gamble.
** This action was taken due to an exploit where his gambling mini-game could be manipulated by 3rd-party tools, causing an infinite gil glitch.
** Varchet returned to his usual spot to try to win his fortune back a few weeks later.[2]

